-- title:
--   Parabolic Tₚ-eigenvalue as an integral polynomial in the T_ℓ-eigenvalues
-- statement:
--   Let $M\ge 1$ be a natural number, let $S\subseteq\mathbb N$ be a finite set, and let $p$ be a prime not dividing $M$. Write $\Gamma =$ [`CohCarrier.GammaH M ⊤`](def/CohCarrier_Level.html#L133), the image in $\mathrm{SL}_2(\mathbb Z)$ of the full preimage under the lower-right-entry character of $\Gamma_0(M)$ of the top subgroup of $(\mathbb Z/M)^\times$, i.e. $\Gamma_0(M)$ itself, and let $L$ be the set of primes $\ell\notin S$ with $\ell\nmid M$. The assertion is that there exist a non-zero $n\in\mathbb N$ and a polynomial $P\in\mathbb Z[X_\ell:\ell\in L]$ with the following uniform property. For every commutative integral domain $A$ of characteristic zero, every additive homomorphism $\varphi:\mathrm{Additive}\,\Gamma\to A$ (the type [`CohCarrier.H1 M ⊤ A`](def/CohCarrier_Level.html#L162)) lying in [`ModularCurve.Period.parabolicHoms`](def/ModularCurve_PeriodMap.html#L62), that is, vanishing on every $\gamma\in\Gamma$ whose matrix satisfies $(\operatorname{tr}\gamma)^2=4$, with $\varphi\neq 0$, and for all scalars $a:L\to A$ and $b\in A$ such that the transfer Hecke operators satisfy [`CohCarrier.heckeT M ⊤ ℓ A`](def/CohCarrier_Level.html#L250) $\varphi=a_\ell\cdot\varphi$ for every $\ell\in L$ and [`CohCarrier.heckeT M ⊤ p A`](def/CohCarrier_Level.html#L250) $\varphi=b\cdot\varphi$, one has $n\,b=P\bigl((a_\ell)_{\ell\in L}\bigr)$ in $A$, the right-hand side being the evaluation of $P$ at $a$. No assumption relates $p$ to $S$.
--
--   This is the integrality-and-uniformity form of the statement that the Hecke operator $T_p$ on parabolic cohomology of $\Gamma_0(M)$ lies in the algebra generated by the $T_\ell$ for $\ell$ outside any prescribed finite set of primes, here transported to eigenvalues of a single eigenclass with a single denominator $n$ and a single polynomial $P$ valid for all characteristic-zero coefficient domains at once. It is used to compare Hecke eigenvalues at auxiliary primes, feeding [`CohCarrier.heckeT_sub_algebraMap_mem_of_isMaximal_of_not_dvd`](thm.html#CohCarrier.heckeT_sub_algebraMap_mem_of_isMaximal_of_not_dvd) and the identification of corner values of local Hecke data for cusp forms.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_CohCarrier_exists_mvPolynomial_heckeT_eigenvalue_of_mem_parabolicHoms_gammaH_top.lean

import Definitions.Def_CohCarrier_Level
